#. そうだ。この学園に来る前に見た、
#. <CLT 3>雑誌の表紙<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right! It was before I ever came to this\n"
"school. I remember seeing a <CLT 3>magazine cover<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクは…その顔を見てるんだ…！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And...you were on it!"
msgstr ""

#. へぇ…なかなか優秀な記憶力じゃん。
#. ここまで生き残っただけあるみたいだね…
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Wow, you have a pretty good memory. I guess that's why\n"
"you've made it this far, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、そうだったんだな…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So I was right..."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、最初の玄関ホールで、
#. ボクが聞いた言葉って…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then what you told me in the main hall when this\n"
"all began..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、なんか…雑誌で見たのと…
#. 見た目の印象が違う気が…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I've seen her on tons of magazine covers, but...\n"
"I feel like that doesn't quite match up to reality."
msgstr ""

#. はい…？
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. あぁ、もしかして雑誌のカバーショットの事、
#. 言ってんの？
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Oh, are you talking about my cover photos and junk?"
msgstr "À, không lẽ cậu đang nói về mấy cái ảnh bìa tạp chí này nọ hả?"

#. アハハ、当たり前じゃーん！
#. あれは雑誌用に盛ってるんだって！
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Ahaha, well of course! Those are totally photoshopped."
msgstr ""
"A ha ha, tất nhiên rồi! Ba cái đó là phải chỉnh sửa cho\n"
"lung linh chứ."

#. …盛ってる？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Photoshopped...?"
msgstr "...Chỉnh sửa?"

#. だからさ…加工してんだって！
#. 画像編集ソフト知ってんでしょ？
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you know—edited to hell and back. With like,\n"
"computers and junk?"
msgstr ""
"Thì là hậu kỳ đó! Cậu có biết mấy cái phần mềm chỉnh sửa\n"
"ảnh trên máy tính này nọ không?"

#. か、加工…そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, so they aren't real..."
msgstr "H-Hậu kỳ... ra là vậy..."

#. 時には、自分にウソをつく事も必要…
#. そういう前向きさもあると思うんだよね。
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Sometimes a little lie is necessary to keep things\n"
"moving along, wouldn't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、別人だから見た目の印象が違うのは当然…
#. そういう事か…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That explains why she didn't quite seem the same.\n"
"Because she was a different person all along..."
msgstr ""

#. アタシはアタシ、むくろはむくろ…
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm me, and Mukuro is Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. いくら盛ったところで、
#. 彼女が“超高校級のギャル”になるのは不可能なんだ。
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"She tried her best, but there's just no way she could\n"
"have passed as the Ultimate Fashionista."
msgstr ""

#. 肉体と意識の壁が存在する限り、
#. 人と人とは、決して１つにはなれないんだよ…
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Two people can never become one as long as the walls\n"
"of mind and body exist..."
msgstr ""

#. たとえ、双子だとしてもね。
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Not even if they're twins."
msgstr ""

#. ふ、双子…！？
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "T-Twins!?"
msgstr ""

#. よくある設定なんだよ。
#. だから、今更言うのも恥ずかしいんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I know, it's such a cliche, right? I'm almost\n"
"embarrassed to admit it."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、アタシとむくろは双子の関係にあるんだ。
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So basically, Mukuro and I had your stereotypical\n"
"\"twin\" relationship..."
msgstr ""

#. 体力自慢の姉という設定が、戦刃むくろ…
#. 可愛くて天才でしかも妹という設定が、アタシ…
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The older sister, tough and proud—that was Mukuro. The\n"
"younger sister, smart and cute—that was..."
msgstr ""

#. ひゃははは！　江ノ島盾子ちゃーん！
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hyaaaahaha! Me! Junko fucking Enoshima!"
msgstr ""

#. オレら、姉妹揃って<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>の
#. 絶望シスターズでしたー！
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And together, we were the Despair Sisters! AKA the\n"
"<CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…急にキャラ変わってねーか？
msgctxt "0025 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whoa, she's a totally different person now!"
msgstr ""

#. 言っただろ！？　絶望的に飽きっぽいんだ！
#. だから、自分のキャラにすら飽きちまうんだよ！！
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I get bored easy as hell! I even get\n"
"fuckin' bored with myself!"
msgstr ""

#. で、でも双子の姉妹なのに…
#. なんで…苗字が違うの…？
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"B-But if you're twins, why do you have d-different\n"
"last names?"
msgstr ""

#. まーた、その質問かよ…
#. よく聞かれるんだよなぁ…
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Ugh, that again? You have any idea how many times\n"
"people ask me that shit?"
msgstr ""

#. そっちは初めてでも、こっちは絶望的に飽きてんだよ！
#. 何度も何度も、同じ質問に答えさせられてよぉ！！
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Maybe it's new to your dumb ass, but it bores me to\n"
"tears! Answering the same questions, over and over!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、よくある話だから勝手に想像しろ！
#. それが正解でいいぜ！
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Just make up whatever answer you want, I don't give a\n"
"shit! The truth's fuckin' lame, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. でも…双子の姉妹って事は…
#. あんたは…お姉さんを殺したの…？
msgctxt "0031 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But...if she was your twin, that means...you killed\n"
"your own sister?"
msgstr ""

#. それには、海より深い事情があるんだ！
#. ウソだよ！　ねーよ！
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And for reasons deeper and darker than the ocean!\n"
"...Hah! As if!"
msgstr ""

#. 仕方がないですね…
#. 私から説明しましょう。
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Well, I suppose I'd better explain..."
msgstr ""

#. 今回の計画において、コロシアイ学園生活を
#. 裏でコントロールする役目は必須でした。
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"For my plan to work, someone had to be able to control\n"
"the killing game from behind the scenes."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの操作や、あなた方の見張り…
#. いわゆる黒幕の役目ですね…
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The so-called mastermind had to operate Monokuma, keep\n"
"an eye on everyone, things like that."
msgstr ""

#. ですが、私の計算上、
#. 戦刃むくろでは、その責務を果たすのは不可能でした。
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But after looking at the situation, I determined it\n"
"would be impossible for Mukuro to perform such duties."
msgstr ""

#. なぜなら、彼女は残念なお姉ちゃんだからです。
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Because naturally, she turned out to be the letdown of\n"
"the family."
msgstr ""

#. １人で傭兵団に入ったりするような、
#. 残念過ぎるお姉ちゃんだからです。
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Leaving me behind to run off and join some band of\n"
"mercenaries... Such a disappointment."
msgstr ""

#. なので、私がコントロール役に回り、
#. 彼女は表の学園生活に残ってもらう事にしました。
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, I decided to play the role of director and have\n"
"her join the rest of you in your school life."
msgstr ""

#. ２人共が裏に回るという選択肢もありましたが、
#. 彼女がいたところで、私の助けにはなりませんし…
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I could have let her work alongside me, but she would\n"
"have been useless to me that way."
msgstr ""

#. それに<CLT 3>“１５人の参加者”<CLT>だと、
#. キリもいいですからね。
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Besides, <CLT 3>15 students<CLT> seemed like a solid number to\n"
"start with."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、そこで問題となったのは、
#. 戦刃むくろの<CLT 3>“超高校級の軍人”<CLT>という肩書き…
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Of course, the fact that she was the <CLT 3>Ultimate\n"
"Soldier<CLT> posed something of a problem."
msgstr ""

#. いわゆる“３Ｚ”ですね。
#. 絶望的に臭い、絶望的に汚い、絶望的に気持ち悪い…
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"She had what I call the \"three atrocities\"—atrociously\n"
"rank, atrociously filthy, atrociously repulsive."
msgstr ""

#. 社会のニーズから大きく外れている事は、
#. わざわざ計算しなくてもわかります。
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It was atrociously clear just how out of touch she was\n"
"with the rest of society."
msgstr ""

#. 一方、私の<CLT 3>“超高校級のギャル”<CLT>には華もあり、
#. 捨てるにはもったいない…
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, my \"<CLT 3>Ultimate Fashionista<CLT>\" status has an\n"
"undeniable appeal that I didn't want to go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. だから…入れ替わった…？
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And that's...why you switched identities?"
msgstr ""

#. ですが、計算以上に、私に似ていませんでしたね。
#. それはもう…絶望的なほどに…
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Sadly, her inability to match my personality was even\n"
"greater than I'd calculated. It was a lost cause..."
msgstr ""

#. あれでは、ただの雑魚キャラ…
#. もしくはエキストラＡ…
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"She was nothing more than a bit player, an extra\n"
"unworthy of lines."
msgstr ""

#. その残念なヴィジュアルも相まって、
#. 彼女がすぐに殺されると予想した人も多いはずです。
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Being the utter disappointment that she was, anyone\n"
"would have expected her to get killed off right away."
msgstr ""

#. だから殺しました。ご期待に添えたくて。
msgctxt "0050 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Which is precisely why I killed her—to meet everyone's\n"
"expectations."
msgstr ""

#. まさか…それだけの理由で…？
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That...can't be your only reason, can it?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、それだけではありません。
#. 飽きてしまったという明確な理由もあります。
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well no, of course not. I also did it to avoid\n"
"becoming bored."
msgstr ""

#. わたしってね…計画通りに物事を進めた事が、
#. 今まで１度もないんだぁ…
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I've never been a stickler for following a plan to the\n"
"letter, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. 計画しただけで先が見えちゃって、
#. それで、飽きちゃうって言うかぁ…
msgctxt "0054 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If I planned everything out and knew just what was\n"
"gonna happen, that'd be sooo boooring!"
msgstr ""

#. だから予定変更して、むくろちゃんには
#. <CLT 3>“見せしめ役”<CLT>になってもらう事にしたのっ！
msgctxt "0055 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, I changed things just a bit, and decided to use\n"
"Mukuro to <CLT 3>make a little point<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、戦刃むくろの死は、
#. あなたが一方的に仕組んだ<CLT 3>裏切り<CLT>行為…
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In other words, Mukuro's death was a one-sided,\n"
"premeditated act of <CLT 3>betrayal<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そうだと思ったわ…
msgctxt "0057 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Just as I suspected..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろが殺された時…
#. 彼女は明らかに予想外だと思っていたはずだもの…
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When Mukuro was killed, she must have been as\n"
"surprised as anybody else."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. は……？
msgctxt "0060 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Wh...?"
msgstr "Cái...?"

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0061 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "H-Huh?"
msgstr "Cái... gì...?"

#. お…おかしくない…？
msgctxt "0062 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "This wasn't...supposed to..."
msgstr "Ch-Chuyện này... chẳng phải rất lạ sao...?"

#. なんで……あたしが…………？
msgctxt "0063 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Why...me...?"
msgstr "Tại sao... lại là tôi...?"

#. てへ、やっぱバレちゃった？
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Eh-heh! So you figured it out?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよねぇ。むくろちゃんに、
#. あんな迫真の演技が出来る訳ないもんねぇ。
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well you're right! There's no way Mukuro could have\n"
"pulled off such a convincing performance!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさぁ、そのお陰で、
#. いい感じの、見せしめっぷりになったと思わない？
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But she did teach you all a very valuable lesson,\n"
"don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. どうして…平気なんだよ…
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How can you talk like that...?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分のお姉さんを犠牲にしておいて…
#. どうして…平気でいられるんだよ…！？
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You sacrificed your own sister... How does that not\n"
"even bother you!?"
msgstr ""

#. えー！？　わたしがむくろちゃんを犠牲にしたぁ？
#. だから怒ってんのぉ？
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What? I sacrificed her? That's what's got you so hot\n"
"under the collar?"
msgstr ""

#. やだぁ！　勘違いって怖ーい！！
msgctxt "0071 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Jeez, misunderstandings sure are scary!"
msgstr ""

#. わたし達は“超高校級の絶望”なんだよぉ？
#. だから、生きる事に希望なんて感じてないって言うか…
msgctxt "0072 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We were the Ultimate Despair, ya know? So we never had\n"
"any kind of hope, or expectations."
msgstr ""

#. むしろ、生まれた瞬間に世界に絶望してるの。
#. 間違った…生まれて来なきゃよかった…って。
msgctxt "0073 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"No, I've felt despair as long as I can remember, like\n"
"I never should have been born at all."
msgstr ""

#. わたしが生まれた時に流した涙も、
#. そんな絶望の涙だったんだよ。
msgctxt "0074 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "When I was born, I cried tears of total despair."
msgstr ""

#. だからね、わたし達にとっては、
#. 死ぬとか殺すとか大した問題じゃないの。
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So that's why for us, it's not a big deal whether we\n"
"die or kill!"
msgstr ""

#. わたし達は“そういう人間”なの。
#. だからこそ、なんでも出来るんだよ。
msgctxt "0076 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "We're just those kinds of people. We can do anything!"
msgstr ""

#. 常に絶望してるからこそ、
#. 命を惜しまぬ全力投球って訳さ！
msgctxt "0077 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We've always been filled with despair, so when we do\n"
"something, we go all the way and live without regret!"
msgstr ""

#. なんとも思ってないって事…？
#. 自分のお姉さんを…殺しておいて…
msgctxt "0078 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So you just murdered your own sister, and didn't think\n"
"anything of it...?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな訳ないじゃないですか…
msgctxt "0079 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's not true at all..."
msgstr ""

#. 双子の姉妹なんですよ…
#. 悲しくない訳ないじゃないですか…
msgctxt "0080 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "We were twins. How could I not be sad?"
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ<CLT 3>“ソソる”<CLT>んですけどね…
msgctxt "0081 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's why it gets me so...<CLT 3>excited<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. 大好きなお姉ちゃんを自分の手で殺すなんて…
msgctxt "0083 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Killing my precious sister with my own two hands..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望的ですよね…
#. 超を付けたくなるほどの超絶望的ですよね…
msgctxt "0084 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That act is filled with so much despair, you can't\n"
"help but put a \"super\" in front of it."
msgstr ""

#. 超超超超絶望的…
#. まだ…もっとですね…
msgctxt "0085 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It's like super super super super super despair. No,\n"
"more than that..."
msgstr ""

#. 超超超超超超超超超超超超超超超絶望的過ぎて…
msgctxt "0086 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Super super super super super super super super super\n"
"super super super super super super despair..."
msgstr ""

#. カイカン…です…
msgctxt "0087 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It just feels...so...good..."
msgstr ""

#. オ、オメー…何言ってんだ…？
msgctxt "0088 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What the hell is wrong with you...?"
msgstr ""

#. むくろ姉さんも…
#. 死ぬ瞬間は絶望してたと思うんです…
msgctxt "0089 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And my sister, too... In that moment of death, I think\n"
"she must have felt that despair."
msgstr ""

#. だって、実の妹に殺されて…
#. しかも、ただの見せしめとしてですよ…？
msgctxt "0090 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"After all, to be murdered by your own sister, and only\n"
"as an example to someone else...?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと絶望しながら…死んだんだと思います……
msgctxt "0091 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"She must have died feeling such excruciating\n"
"hopelessness..."
msgstr ""

#. だから…うらやましいんです…
#. 超うらやましいんです…
msgctxt "0092 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm so...jealous of her. Super jealous..."
msgstr ""

#. ただ者ではないと思っていたが…
#. やはり変態だったか…
msgctxt "0093 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I knew you couldn't be just some ordinary person.\n"
"You're some kind of...abnormality."
msgstr ""

#. 自分自身の絶望すら取り込む“究極の絶望フェチ”…
#. 最低に厄介な変態ね…
msgctxt "0094 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Turning your own despair into some kind of fetish...\n"
"Abnormality doesn't even begin to describe it."
msgstr ""

#. ジェノサイダーもイカれてっけど…
#. それとは違ったイカれ方だべ…
msgctxt "0095 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Like, Genocide Jill is crazy for sure, but...this is a\n"
"whole nother level of nuts!"
msgstr ""

#. あのぉ…弱者を殺す事しか能がない殺人鬼さんと…
#. 一緒にして欲しくないって言いますか…
msgctxt "0096 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You're saying I don't compare to some lowly beast that\n"
"can only kill the weak, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 私って…絶望的に容姿端麗で…
#. 絶望的に頭脳明晰で…絶望的に身体能力抜群な…
msgctxt "0097 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So I'm hopelessly attractive? Hopelessly brilliant?\n"
"Hopelessly athletic...?"
msgstr ""

#. 絶望的に、完璧超人設定なんですよ…？
msgctxt "0098 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm the hopelessly perfect ultimate human?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、その程度では完璧とは程遠いな…
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"No...I don't think there's anything \"perfect\" about\n"
"anything you just said."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうよ！　白夜様の方が完璧よ…！
#. そこに“高貴な血統”も…プラスされるんだから…ッ！
msgctxt "0100 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Master's way more p-perfect! Cuz on top of\n"
"everything else, he's got that n-noble blood!"
msgstr ""

#. でも…それって…
#. “以前は”高貴な血統ですよね…？
msgctxt "0101 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? Don't you mean...*had* that noble blood?"
msgstr ""

#. なんだと…どういう意味だ？
msgctxt "0102 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What did you just say? What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…まだ気付いてないの？
#. オマエラって、ホントにニブチンだね！
msgctxt "0103 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. You still haven't figured that part out yet?\n"
"Man you guys are so sloooow!"
msgstr ""

#. そのくせ、キャンキャン騒いじゃってさ！
#. まだ解けてない謎もあるって言うのにね！
msgctxt "0104 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You haven't even solved all the mysteries, and yet\n"
"here you are, yap-yap-yapping away!"
msgstr ""

#. それって…私達の記憶の事…？
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you talking about our memories...?"
msgstr ""

#. 謎はすべて解けた。犯人はボクだ。
#. だから、どうしたって言うの？
msgctxt "0106 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You've already solved this mystery, right? I'm the\n"
"killer. So how about the next one?"
msgstr ""

#. 勝ち誇るのは、オマエラの記憶の秘密を
#. 解いてからにしてもらえる？
msgctxt "0107 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Maybe you should solve the riddle of your missing\n"
"memories, *then* you can start gloating."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、そのつもりだ…
#. ボク達がすべて解き明かしてみせる…
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Damn straight! That's exactly what we're going to do.\n"
"We're going to solve all these mysteries..."
msgstr ""

#. そして…お前に勝ってみせる！
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And then...we'll have our victory!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…楽しみだね…
msgctxt "0110 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu. I can't wait..."
msgstr ""

#. よし！　じゃあ単刀直入に聞くべ！
#. 俺達のどんな記憶を奪ったんだ！？
msgctxt "0111 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Alright! Then let's just get straight to the point!\n"
"What memories did you steal from us!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0112 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 集合写真の撮影や…面談の記憶…
#. という事は…
msgctxt "0113 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"When the g-group pictures were taken... A-And those\n"
"interviews... It must mean..."
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかった！
#. きっと…入学試験の記憶よ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0114 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I g-got it! It must have s-something to do with our\n"
"entrance e-exams!"
msgstr ""

#. シーン……
msgctxt "0115 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hmmmmmmm..."
msgstr ""

#. 汚ねーぞ！　ヒントくらい教えろって！
msgctxt "0116 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No fair! At least give us a hint!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエらって脳がスポンジなんだね…
#. ヒントならさっき言ったじゃん。
msgctxt "0117 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Your brains are like sponges, all drippy and leaky. I\n"
"already gave you a hint before!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラから奪った記憶は<CLT 3>“ある事”<CLT>と、
#. 関係してるってさ！
msgctxt "0118 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"All the memories you lost share something in common\n"
"with <CLT 3>a few other things<CLT>... Do you recall?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが用意した動機
msgctxt "0119 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The motives Monokuma came up with"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判の内容
msgctxt "0120 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The class trials"
msgstr ""

#. はッ！　これまでの学級裁判の事を
#. 全然思い出せねーべ！
msgctxt "0121 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What!? Hey, he's right! I don't remember a thing about\n"
"any of the other class trials!"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判の記憶を奪われたんだべ！！
msgctxt "0122 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "All my class trial memories are totally gone!"
msgstr ""

#. 全然、思い出せるし…
#. アンタがバカなだけじゃん…
msgctxt "0123 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I remember them just fine. The real problem is, you're\n"
"an idiot."
msgstr ""

#. んなッ！？
msgctxt "0124 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、俺だけだべ！
#. 俺だけ学級裁判の記憶を奪われたんだべ！！
msgctxt "0125 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Then I must be the only one! They stole my memories\n"
"and nobody else's!"
msgstr ""

#. あらら、証明されちゃったね。
msgctxt "0126 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Dang, now that I think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. バカなオマエの記憶なんて、
#. わざわざ奪う必要なかったって事が…
msgctxt "0127 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"...I didn't even need to steal your memories. Cuz of\n"
"how stupid you are."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0128 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンって…
#. 本当に残念なんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro's taken \"disappointing\" to a whole new level...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 希望ヶ峰学園創設の秘密
msgctxt "0131 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The founding of Hope's Peak Academy"
msgstr ""

#. ナニソレ？
#. 何百年も前の事とか、どぉーでもいいんだけど。
msgctxt "0132 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What the hell? Who gives a crap about something that\n"
"happened a billion years ago?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンの答えは飽きたよ…
msgctxt "0133 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Your answers bore me."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンは、超高校級の退屈だよ…
msgctxt "0134 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "From now on, you're the Ultimate Snoozefest."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>心が折れそうだけど、しっかりしないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can feel my spirit breaking...but I have to get\n"
"myself together!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>落ち着いてもう１度考えよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to calm down and think about it one more\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、ボクら自身と密接に関係してる事だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's gotta be something related to us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. そんな顔しても、もうヒントはあげないよ。
msgctxt "0139 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Make that stupid face all you want, I'm not giving you\n"
"any more hints!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0140 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu..."
msgstr "U pư pư..."

#. <CLT 4>ボクたちは…奪われた記憶のせいで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because of the memories that were taken, we...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0142 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば…
#. 確かに、モノクマが言ってたな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thinking back to what Monokuma's told us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらの奪われた記憶…
#. それと関係している“ある事”について…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The memories that were stolen from us, and what they\n"
"must be related to...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
